sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant S as HTTP Server
    participant O as OpenAI-compatible Layer
    participant T as Tokenizer
    participant Q as Scheduler
    participant M as Model Executor
    participant K as KV Cache
    participant D as Detokenizer

    C->>S: POST /v1/chat/completions
    S->>O: parse request
    O->>T: tokenize prompt
    T->>Q: enqueue tokenized request
    Q->>M: prefill
    M->>K: write KV cache
    Q->>M: decode loop
    M->>K: read/update KV cache
    M->>D: token ids
    D-->>S: text chunks
    S-->>C: JSON or streaming chunks
